            "review_title": "Review at CƠM GÀ PHỐ - HANOI CHICKEN RICE",
            "review_text": "Dao C\n3 contributions\n0\nNew chicken rice resto\nSep 2026 • Family\nWe stumbled upon this restaurant by chance, and it turned out to be a fantastic choice. It is a newly opened Vietnamese-style chicken rice restaurant. My family tried the crispy chicken rice, grilled chicken rice, and Hoi An-style chicken rice—all of them were perfect. The flavors were rich, and the meat was fresh and delicious. The restaurant offers a spacious, refined atmosphere, providing a nice escape from the hustle and bustle of Hanoi. The staff were also very attentive. 10/10\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 15, 2026",
